  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_221",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_log_exp"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Simplify $\\frac{(a^2 b^{-3})^2}{a^{-1} b^2}$ and express your answer with positive indices.",
    "question_zh": "化簡 $\\frac{(a^2 b^{-3})^2}{a^{-1} b^2}$ 並以正指數表示答案。",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\frac{a^5}{b^8}$",
      "B. $\\frac{a^5}{b^4}$",
      "C. $\\frac{a^3}{b^8}$",
      "D. $a^5 b^4$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "A",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Square the numerator: $(a^2 b^{-3})^2 = a^{2\\times 2} b^{-3\\times 2} = a^4 b^{-6}$.",
      "Divide by the denominator: $\\frac{a^4 b^{-6}}{a^{-1} b^2} = a^{4 - (-1)} b^{-6 - 2}$.",
      "Simplify the powers: $a^5 b^{-8}$.",
      "Convert to positive indices: $\\frac{a^5}{b^8}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "計算分子之平方：$(a^2 b^{-3})^2 = a^4 b^{-6}$。",
      "除以分母：$\\frac{a^4 b^{-6}}{a^{-1} b^2} = a^{4 - (-1)} b^{-6 - 2}$。",
      "化簡指數：$a^5 b^{-8}$。",
      "以正指數表示：$\\frac{a^5}{b^8}$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_222",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_trig_app"],
    "marks": 12,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "In a tetrahedron $VABC$, the base $ABC$ is an equilateral triangle with side length $10\\text{ cm}$. The height of the tetrahedron is $12\\text{ cm}$ and the foot of the perpendicular from $V$ to the base is the centroid $G$ of $ABC$. \\n(a) Find the distance from $A$ to $BC$. (3 marks)\\n(b) Find the length of $VG$. (1 mark)\\n(c) Find the angle between the plane $VBC$ and the base $ABC$. (4 marks)\\n(d) Find the area of the face $VBC$. (4 marks)",
    "question_zh": "在四面體 $VABC$ 中，底 $ABC$ 是一個邊長為 $10\\text{ cm}$ 的等邊三角形。四面體的高為 $12\\text{ cm}$，且由 $V$ 到面 $ABC$ 的垂足為 $ABC$ 的重心 $G$。\n(a) 求 $A$ 與 $BC$ 之間的距離。(3分)\n(b) 求 $VG$ 的長度。(1分)\n(c) 求面 $VBC$ 與底 $ABC$ 之間的交角。(4分)\n(d) 求面 $VBC$ 的面積。(4分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) Let $M$ be the midpoint of $BC$. In equilateral $\\triangle ABC$, $AM \\perp BC$. $AM = 10 \\sin 60^\\circ = 10 \\times \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2} = 5\\sqrt{3} \\approx 8.66\\text{ cm}$.",
      "(b) Given height $VG = 12\\text{ cm}$.",
      "(c) $G$ is the centroid, so $GM = \\frac{1}{3} AM = \\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{3}$. The angle between $VBC$ and $ABC$ is $\\angle VMG$.",
      "$\\tan \\angle VMG = \\frac{VG}{GM} = \\frac{12}{5\\sqrt{3}/3} = \\frac{36}{5\\sqrt{3}} = \\frac{12\\sqrt{3}}{5} \\approx 4.1569$.",
      "$\\angle VMG \\approx \\tan^{-1}(4.1569) \\approx 76.5^\\circ$.",
      "(d) Area $VBC = \\frac{1}{2} \\times BC \\times VM$. $VM = \\sqrt{VG^2 + GM^2} = \\sqrt{144 + 25/3} = \\sqrt{457/3} \\approx 12.34$.",
      "Area $\\approx \\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times 12.34 = 61.7\\text{ cm}^2$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) 設 $M$ 為 $BC$ 的中點。$AM = 10 \\sin 60^\\circ = 5\\sqrt{3} \\approx 8.66\\text{ cm}$。",
      "(b) 已知高 $VG = 12\\text{ cm}$。",
      "(c) $G$ 為重心，故 $GM = \\frac{1}{3} AM = \\frac{5\\sqrt{3}}{3}$。所求角為 $\\angle VMG$。",
      "$\\tan \\angle VMG = \\frac{12}{GM} \\approx 4.1569 \\Rightarrow \\angle VMG \\approx 76.5^\\circ$。",
      "(d) 面 $VBC$ 的面積 $= \\frac{1}{2} \\times 10 \\times VM$。$VM = \\sqrt{12^2 + GM^2} \\approx 12.34$。",
      "Area $\\approx 61.7\\text{ cm}^2$."
    ],
