  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_223",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_analysis"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "If the variance of a set of data $\\{x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n\\}$ is $v$, find the variance of the set $\\{3x_1 - 5, 3x_2 - 5, \\dots, 3x_n - 5\\}$.",
    "question_zh": "若一組數據 $\\{x_1, x_2, \\dots, x_n\\}$ 的方差為 $v$，求數據 $\\{3x_1 - 5, 3x_2 - 5, \\dots, 3x_n - 5\\}$ 的方差。",
    "options": [
      "A. $v$",
      "B. $3v$",
      "C. $3v - 5$",
      "D. $9v$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "D",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Adding/Subtracting a constant does not change the variance.",
      "Multiplying each data point by a constant $k$ changes the variance by a factor of $k^2$.",
      "Here, $k = 3$, so the new variance is $3^2 \\times v = 9v$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "加減常數不改變方差。",
      "將每個數據乘以常數 $k$ 會使方差變為原本的 $k^2$ 倍。",
      "此處 $k = 3$，故新方差為 $3^2 \\times v = 9v$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_224",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_polynomials"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "When the polynomial $P(x) = 2x^3 - kx^2 + 5x - 3$ is divided by $x - 2$, the remainder is 7. Find the value of $k$.",
    "question_zh": "當多項式 $P(x) = 2x^3 - kx^2 + 5x - 3$ 除以 $x - 2$ 時，餘數為 7。求 $k$ 的值。",
    "options": [
      "A. -1",
      "B. 1",
      "C. 4",
      "D. 9"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "C",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "By Remainder Theorem, $P(2) = 7$.",
      "$2(2)^3 - k(2)^2 + 5(2) - 3 = 7$.",
      "$16 - 4k + 10 - 3 = 7$.",
      "$23 - 4k = 7 \\Rightarrow 4k = 16$.",
      "Therefore, $k = 4$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "根據餘數定理，$P(2) = 7$。",
      "$2(2)^3 - k(2)^2 + 5(2) - 3 = 7$。",
      "$16 - 4k + 10 - 3 = 7$。",
      "$23 - 4k = 7 \\Rightarrow 4k = 16 \\Rightarrow k = 4$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_225",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_trig_app"],
    "marks": 11,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In $\\triangle ABC$, $AB = 8\\text{ cm}$, $\\angle BAC = 45^\\circ$, and $\\angle ABC = 60^\\circ$. \\n(a) Find the length of $AC$. (4 marks)\\n(b) Find the area of $\\triangle ABC$. (4 marks)\\n(c) Find the length of the altitude from $A$ to $BC$. (3 marks)",
    "question_zh": "在 $\\triangle ABC$ 中，$AB = 8\\text{ cm}$，$\\angle BAC = 45^\\circ$ 且 $\\angle ABC = 60^\\circ$。\n(a) 求 $AC$ 的長度。(4分)\n(b) 求 $\\triangle ABC$ 的面積。(4分)\n(c) 求由 $A$ 到 $BC$ 的高。(3分)",
    "diagram_json": {
      "elements": [
        { "type": "polyline", "points": [{ "x": 100, "y": 200 }, { "x": 250, "y": 200 }, { "x": 150, "y": 80 }, { "x": 100, "y": 200 }], "stroke": "#7c3aed", "strokeWidth": 2, "fill": "rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.05)" },
        { "type": "arc", "center": { "x": 100, "y": 200 }, "r": 35, "startAngle": 0, "endAngle": 67, "label": "60°", "stroke": "#ef4444" },
        { "type": "arc", "center": { "x": 150, "y": 80 }, "r": 35, "startAngle": 247, "endAngle": 310, "label": "45°", "stroke": "#ef4444" },
        { "type": "point", "x": 100, "y": 200, "label": "B", "labelDx": -15, "labelDy": 10 },
        { "type": "point", "x": 250, "y": 200, "label": "C", "labelDx": 10, "labelDy": 10 },
        { "type": "point", "x": 150, "y": 80, "label": "A", "labelDy": -15 },
        { "type": "text", "x": 125, "y": 140, "text": "8 cm", "dx": -15, "textAnchor": "end", "fill": "#1f2937", "fontSize": 12, "fontWeight": "bold" }
      ],
      "canvas": { "width": 400, "height": 300, "viewBox": "60 50 220 180" }
    },
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) $\\angle ACB = 180^\\circ - 45^\\circ - 60^\\circ = 75^\\circ$.",
      "By Sine Rule: $\\frac{AC}{\\sin 60^\\circ} = \\frac{8}{\\sin 75^\\circ}$.",
      "$AC = \\frac{8 \\sin 60^\\circ}{\\sin 75^\\circ} \\approx 7.17\\text{ cm}$.",
      "(b) Area $= \\frac{1}{2} AB \\cdot AC \\sin \\angle BAC = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 8 \\times 7.17 \\times \\sin 45^\\circ$.",
      "Area $\\approx 20.3\\text{ cm}^2$.",
      "(c) Let $h$ be the altitude. $h = 8 \\sin 60^\\circ = 4\\sqrt{3} \\approx 6.93\\text{ cm}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $\\angle ACB = 75^\\circ$。利用正弦定理：$AC = \\frac{8 \\sin 60^\\circ}{\\sin 75^\\circ} \\approx 7.17\\text{ cm}$。",
      "(b) 面積 $= \\frac{1}{2} (8)(7.17) \\sin 45^\\circ \\approx 20.3\\text{ cm}^2$。",
      "(c) 高 $h = 8 \\sin 60^\\circ = 4\\sqrt{3} \\approx 6.93\\text{ cm}$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_226",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_apgp"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 5,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "In an arithmetic sequence, the 5th term is 14 and the 12th term is 35. Find the 20th term.",
    "question_zh": "在一等差數列中，第 5 項為 14，第 12 項為 35。求第 20 項。",
    "options": [
      "A. 56",
      "B. 59",
      "C. 62",
      "D. 65"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Let $a$ be the first term and $d$ be the common difference.",
      "$a + 4d = 14$ (Eq 1). $a + 11d = 35$ (Eq 2).",
      "Subtract Eq 1 from Eq 2: $7d = 21 \\Rightarrow d = 3$.",
      "Substitute into Eq 1: $a + 12 = 14 \\Rightarrow a = 2$.",
      "20th term $= a + 19d = 2 + 19(3) = 2 + 57 = 59$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "設首項為 $a$，公差為 $d$。",
      "$a + 4d = 14$ 及 $a + 11d = 35$。",
      "相減得 $7d = 21 \\Rightarrow d = 3$。代入得 $a = 2$。",
      "第 20 項 $= a + 19d = 2 + 57 = 59$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_mcq_227",
    "type": "mcq",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_geo_circle_eq"],
    "marks": 1,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 2,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "The straight line $y = x + k$ is a tangent to the circle $x^2 + y^2 = 8$. Find the possible values of $k$.",
    "question_zh": "直線 $y = x + k$ 是圓 $x^2 + y^2 = 8$ 的切線。求 $k$ 的可能值。",
    "options": [
      "A. $\\pm 2$",
      "B. $\\pm 4$",
      "C. $\\pm 8$",
      "D. $\\pm 16$"
    ],
    "correct_answer": "B",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Substitute $y = x + k$ into $x^2 + y^2 = 8$.",
      "$x^2 + (x + k)^2 = 8 \\Rightarrow x^2 + x^2 + 2kx + k^2 - 8 = 0$.",
      "$2x^2 + 2kx + (k^2 - 8) = 0$.",
      "For tangent, discriminant $\\Delta = 0$.",
      "$(2k)^2 - 4(2)(k^2 - 8) = 0$.",
      "$4k^2 - 8k^2 + 64 = 0 \\Rightarrow -4k^2 = -64$.",
      "$k^2 = 16 \\Rightarrow k = \\pm 4$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "代入 $y = x + k$ 得 $2x^2 + 2kx + (k^2 - 8) = 0$。",
      "對於切線，判別式 $\\Delta = 0$。",
      "$(2k)^2 - 4(2)(k^2 - 8) = 0 \\Rightarrow 4k^2 - 8k^2 + 64 = 0$。",
      "$4k^2 = 64 \\Rightarrow k^2 = 16 \\Rightarrow k = \\pm 4$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
  {
    "id": "ct_sa_228",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_stat_prob"],
    "marks": 13,
    "difficulty": 7,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "B",
    "question_en": "A bag contains 5 red balls and 3 green balls. Two balls are drawn one by one without replacement. \\n(a) What is the probability that both balls are red? (4 marks)\\n(b) What is the probability that the two balls are of different colors? (5 marks)\\n(c) Given that the second ball is red, what is the probability that the first ball was also red? (4 marks)",
    "question_zh": "袋子中有 5 個紅球和 3 個綠球。每次抽出一個球且不放回，共抽出兩個。 \n(a) 求兩個球都是紅色的概率。(4分)\n(b) 求兩個球顏色不同的概率。(5分)\n(c) 已知第二個球是紅色，求第一個球也是紅色的概率。(4分)",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "(a) $P(R1 \\cap R2) = P(R1) \\times P(R2|R1) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{20}{56} = \\frac{5}{14}$.",
      "(b) $P(\\text{different}) = P(R1 \\cap G2) + P(G1 \\cap R2)$.",
      "$P(R1 \\cap G2) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{3}{7} = \\frac{15}{56}$.",
      "$P(G1 \\cap R2) = \\frac{3}{8} \\times \\frac{5}{7} = \\frac{15}{56}$.",
      "$P(\\text{different}) = \\frac{30}{56} = \\frac{15}{28}$.",
      "(c) Conditional probability $P(R1|R2) = \\frac{P(R1 \\cap R2)}{P(R2)}$.",
      "$P(R2) = P(R1 \\cap R2) + P(G1 \\cap R2) = \\frac{20}{56} + \\frac{15}{56} = \\frac{35}{56} = \\frac{5}{8}$.",
      "$P(R1|R2) = \\frac{20/56}{35/56} = \\frac{20}{35} = \\frac{4}{7}$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "(a) $P(\\text{兩紅}) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{4}{7} = \\frac{5}{14}$。",
      "(b) $P(\\text{不同色}) = \\frac{5}{8} \\times \\frac{3}{7} + \\frac{3}{8} \\times \\frac{5}{7} = \\frac{30}{56} = \\frac{15}{28}$。",
      "(c) $P(R1|R2) = \\frac{P(R1 \\cap R2)}{P(R2)}$。",
      "$P(R2) = \\frac{20}{56} + \\frac{15}{56} = \\frac{35}{56} = \\frac{5}{8}$。",
      "$P(R1|R2) = \\frac{20}{35} = \\frac{4}{7}$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  },
