  {
    "id": "ct_sa_230",
    "type": "short_answer",
    "topic_id": "integrated_challenge",
    "prerequisite_topics": ["math_alg_quadratics"],
    "marks": 10,
    "difficulty": 6,
    "paper": 1,
    "section": "A",
    "question_en": "Solve the simultaneous equations \\n$\\begin{cases} y = x^2 - 4x + 7 \\\\ y = 2x - 1 \\end{cases}$",
    "question_zh": "解聯立方程 \n$\\begin{cases} y = x^2 - 4x + 7 \\\\ y = 2x - 1 \\end{cases}$",
    "solution_steps_en": [
      "Substitute $y = 2x - 1$ into the first equation:",
      "$2x - 1 = x^2 - 4x + 7$.",
      "Rearrange into standard quadratic form: $x^2 - 6x + 8 = 0$.",
      "Factorize the quadratic: $(x - 2)(x - 4) = 0$.",
      "Solutions for $x$: $x_1 = 2$ and $x_2 = 4$.",
      "Find corresponding $y$ values:",
      "When $x = 2$, $y = 2(2) - 1 = 3$.",
      "When $x = 4$, $y = 2(4) - 1 = 7$.",
      "The solutions are $(2, 3)$ and $(4, 7)$."
    ],
    "solution_steps_zh": [
      "將 $y = 2x - 1$ 代入第一個方程：$2x - 1 = x^2 - 4x + 7$。",
      "整理得 $x^2 - 6x + 8 = 0$。",
      "因式分解：$(x - 2)(x - 4) = 0$。",
      "解得 $x = 2$ 或 $x = 4$。",
      "當 $x = 2$ 時，$y = 3$。當 $x = 4$ 時，$y = 7$。",
      "聯立方程的解為 $(2, 3)$ 及 $(4, 7)$。"
    ],
    "status": "approved"
  }
]
